{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Available for PC, with native VR and Virtual Pinball Cabinet support.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: Neural pathways may rewire during gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side effects include questioning existence, seeing m\ufeffusic as pinball trajectories, loss of objective reality and uncontrollable urge to replay. Infected Mushroom and Rayworks are not responsible for any lost sense of time, space, or sanity. Consult your shaman if effects persist.<br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Quick tips for making the top 10</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes - You earn the most points by completing Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/cbeaab635a20519b04d805c4b3f9d6d0.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/cbeaab635a20519b04d805c4b3f9d6d0.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/cbeaab635a20519b04d805c4b3f9d6d0.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mode selection begins when the middle mushroom eats the ball. By completing game modes, you earn a lot of points, and new modes will unlock as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill &amp; Combo Shots -\u00a0Your path to the Extra Ball starts here</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/11838559ff1c0c937e050852d73718ee.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/11838559ff1c0c937e050852d73718ee.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/11838559ff1c0c937e050852d73718ee.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When you see the metal rails moving, it means a combo or skill shot opportunity is active. These shots are a great way to earn points. A successful combo skill shot returns the ball to the plunger, giving you a chance to attempt the Extra Ball skill shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Modes</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Chase the ball into alternate dimensions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/b95eebaf0aeac9b44119a9972dc1f500.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/b95eebaf0aeac9b44119a9972dc1f500.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/b95eebaf0aeac9b44119a9972dc1f500.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find a way to unlock Special Modes, and flow through the melodies with perfect rhythm to make your score skyrocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiball -\u00a0Jackpots grow with every locked ball</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/2ff0ee15ae6bda390b223563b252b51a.avif?t=1763704315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras_big/2ff0ee15ae6bda390b223563b252b51a.avif?t=1763704315 width=800 height=450 /></span>During Multiball, every mushroom on the playfield turns into a Jackpot target. Jackpot value is determined by how many balls are locked when Multiball begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Multiplier -\u00a0Boost your game mode completion bonus, up to 4X</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/ff9cf213c626248528dfa34057cdd0f4.avif?t=1763704315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras_big/ff9cf213c626248528dfa34057cdd0f4.avif?t=1763704315 width=800 height=450 /></span>Earn even more points from game modes by increasing your bonus multiplier. Light up all the top lanes by passing the ball through each one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nudging\u00a0-\u00a0Don\u2019t be shy. This machine likes it rough</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/1c0c860c919b46066f9f4d382f157cc4.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/1c0c860c919b46066f9f4d382f157cc4.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/1c0c860c919b46066f9f4d382f157cc4.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Standing still won\u2019t get you anywhere. Get physical. This baby wants action, and it likes it rough. Shake it and slap it like you mean it. If it tilts, you might\u2019ve gone too far\u2026 or maybe not far enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Multiplier - Find the perfect balance for your playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/ac0560def5ca03bc81918387ad523848.avif?t=1763704315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras_big/ac0560def5ca03bc81918387ad523848.avif?t=1763704315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crank up the table difficulty to boost your point multiplier. Shrink the flippers, raise the challenge of game modes, and fine-tune how easily the machine tilts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mushroom Multiplier - Every flip matters. Build it, don't burn it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/d4537dd6ce6d7ceb3374c7754d49bab1.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/d4537dd6ce6d7ceb3374c7754d49bab1.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/d4537dd6ce6d7ceb3374c7754d49bab1.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As long as no game mode is active, the Mushroom Multiplier grows every time the ball rolls over the inlane switches. Once a game mode begins, you start with the multiplier you\u2019ve built up and have a chance to score big, but every flipper press reduces your multiplier.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1000 Jackpots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/6f79371b1c527fd7572d1dec284be157e3b32e8b.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Target Hits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/b0682644db2358be2be695a5829f093b2e9af945.jpg"},{"name":"Army Of Mushrooms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/3a3c7ebbbca2af1e27064b7287851de52720ec4d.jpg"},{"name":"Breathe Underwater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/b737995a8a8bebe7b5e96f81548e32b1811dae83.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Breathe Underwater","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/92e770bbb510d5c6073e449b4e0282f959ffe62f.jpg"},{"name":"Fly Shimulator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/cce06c55e907d8d139f95a7d16dde8c49d0acff0.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Flying","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/c7506ea2616407ab75bfab2124340bda004a5aac.jpg"},{"name":"Frog Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/a213627852181930c3fabbabfb702c1874e7be52.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Frog Machine Spins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/d4f74c3353961d1ddece2e4ee1aa42b641172190.jpg"},{"name":"Nutmeg","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699650/8632d19c7a69487311ac171838446cf55cd2d93c.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699650?t=1763704315","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3699650?t=1763704315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/f9b0fb59a3de1400cf3002203f306586dbf9ea85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763704315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/f9b0fb59a3de1400cf3002203f306586dbf9ea85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763704315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Available for PC, with native VR and Virtual Pinball Cabinet support.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning: Neural pathways may rewire during gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side effects include questioning existence, seeing m\ufeffusic as pinball trajectories, loss of objective reality and uncontrollable urge to replay. Infected Mushroom and Rayworks are not responsible for any lost sense of time, space, or sanity. Consult your shaman if effects persist.<br><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Quick tips for making the top 10</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes - You earn the most points by completing Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/cbeaab635a20519b04d805c4b3f9d6d0.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/cbeaab635a20519b04d805c4b3f9d6d0.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/cbeaab635a20519b04d805c4b3f9d6d0.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mode selection begins when the middle mushroom eats the ball. By completing game modes, you earn a lot of points, and new modes will unlock as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill &amp; Combo Shots -\u00a0Your path to the Extra Ball starts here</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p