s, you might\u2019ve gone too far\u2026 or maybe not far enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Multiplier - Find the perfect balance for your playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/ac0560def5ca03bc81918387ad523848.avif?t=1763704315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras_big/ac0560def5ca03bc81918387ad523848.avif?t=1763704315 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crank up the table difficulty to boost your point multiplier. Shrink the flippers, raise the challenge of game modes, and fine-tune how easily the machine tilts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mushroom Multiplier - Every flip matters. Build it, don't burn it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/d4537dd6ce6d7ceb3374c7754d49bab1.poster.avif?t=1763704315\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/d4537dd6ce6d7ceb3374c7754d49bab1.webm?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699650/extras/d4537dd6ce6d7ceb3374c7754d49bab1.mp4?t=1763704315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As long as no game mode is active, the Mushroom Multiplier grows every time the ball rolls over the inlane switches. Once a game mode begins, you start with the multiplier you\u2019ve built up and have a chance to score big, but every flipper press reduces your multiplier.</p>","developers":["RAYWORKS"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst